      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.22,
          "end": 7.89,
          "en": "Now back in our application meet up item actually will be a presentational component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 7.92,
          "end": 8.58,
          "en": "Why?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.61,
          "end": 13.44,
          "en": "Because this component should only worry about outputting some content.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 13.47,
          "end": 17.37,
          "en": "Yes, we do have buttons, but for now these buttons don't do anything.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 17.37,
          "end": 23.7,
          "en": "And later, when they will do something, we'll just use these buttons to pass the event to another",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 23.7,
          "end": 25.92,
          "en": "component, which we don't have yet.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 25.95,
          "end": 29.31,
          "en": "We don't have that functionality yet, but we'll do that later.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 29.61,
          "end": 34.65,
          "en": "So for the moment, let's just ensure that we receive data here and we can output that data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 34.77,
          "end": 36.9,
          "en": "Let me shrink my styles for that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 37.66,
          "end": 42.13,
          "en": "How do we then receive data in a component you learned about that to?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 42.92,
          "end": 50.93,
          "en": "Well, we need our script tags and then you use export let and then variable names here like title or",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 50.93,
          "end": 51.32,
          "en": "export.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 51.32,
          "end": 54.74,
          "en": "Let subtitle and you can name these variables whatever you want.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 55.13,
          "end": 63.02,
          "en": "We also can have our image URL whoops export let and by using the export keyword, svelte understands",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 63.02,
          "end": 70.91,
          "en": "that these variables in this component are settable from outside and from outside always means from",
          "zh": ""
        },
